            "sid": "JER 38:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Sedekiya abwira Yeremiya ati “He kugira umuntu umenya ayo magambo, nawe ntuzapfa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko ibikomangoma nibyumva yuko naganiriye nawe, maze bikagusanga bikakubwira biti ‘Tubwire ubu icyo wabwiye umwami ntukiduhishe natwe ntituzakwica, kandi utubwire icyo umwami yakubwiye’, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "maze uzabibwire uti ‘Ninginze umwami ngo atansubiza kwa Yonatani nkahagwa.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko ibikomangoma byose bisanga Yeremiya biramubaza, na we abibwira amagambo ahwanye n'ibyo umwami yamutegetse byose. Maze barorera kuvugana na we, kuko ari nta cyo bamenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
